---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: legionOperator calls emergencyWithdraw(token, to, amount)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_transfer: caller is legionOperator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transfer amount of token to designated address
    q_emit --> [*]: emit EmergencyWithdraw(token, to, amount)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Emergency withdraw has no state precondition checks (emergency override)
        INV-002: Only legionOperator can execute
        INV-003: Pause state does not block emergency operations
    end note
